---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import PortfolioLab from "../../components/PortfolioLab.tsx";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Portfolio Diversification Lab"
  description="An interactive Modern Portfolio Theory tool: watch correlated asset waveforms, a live Monte Carlo simulation, and where your mix sits on the efficient frontier."
>
  <section class="container lab-intro">
    <p class="eyebrow">Interactive Tool</p>
    <h1>Portfolio Diversification Lab</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      Mix up to five assets and watch what happens. The left panel simulates each
      asset's price as a living waveform and draws your rebalanced portfolio on
      top; the right panel shows where your mix lands on the
      <strong>efficient frontier</strong>. The lesson hiding inside: returns add
      up in a straight line, but risk doesn't — because assets don't all move
      together. That gap is diversification.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="container lab-host">
    <PortfolioLab client:load />
  </section>

  <section class="container lab-explainer">
    <div class="prose">
      <h2>How to read it</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Weights</strong> set how much of each asset you hold. Drag them
          and watch both panels respond instantly.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Market correlation</strong> is the key dial. It's how tightly an
          asset moves with the broader market. Low or negative correlation is what
          lets a portfolio be less risky than its parts.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>The frontier</strong> plots thousands of possible mixes by risk
          (left–right) and expected return (up–down). The upper-left edge is
          "efficient" — the most return for a given level of risk.
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Try this: build a 100% stock portfolio, note its risk, then blend in
        bonds. The portfolio's risk falls faster than its return — often you can
        <em>lower risk and barely touch return</em>. That's the free lunch
        <a href="/blog/diversification-the-only-free-lunch/">we wrote about</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .lab-intro {
    padding-block: var(--space-lg) var(--space-md);
    max-width: var(--measure);
  }
  .lede {
    font-size: var(--step-1);
    color: var(--color-text-soft);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .lab-explainer {
    margin-top: var(--space-lg);
  }
</style>

<style is:global>
  /* Categorical asset palette — mid-tones that read on light and dark. */
  :root {
    --pl-c1: #4c78a8;
    --pl-c2: #f58518;
    --pl-c3: #54a24b;
    --pl-c4: #e45756;
    --pl-c5: #b279a2;
    --pl-c6: #72b7b2;
    --pl-c7: #d9a441;
    --pl-c8: #9d755d;
  }

  .pl {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-md);
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }
  @media (min-width: 940px) {
    .pl {
      grid-template-columns: 340px 1fr;
      align-items: start;
    }
  }

  /* ---- Controls ---- */
  .pl-controls {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: var(--space-md);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
  }
  .pl-mode {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 4px;
    background: var(--color-surface-alt);
    padding: 4px;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
  }
  .pl-mode button {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    font-weight: 600;
    padding: 0.45rem 0.5rem;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 7px;
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--color-text-soft);
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .pl-mode button.active {
    background: var(--color-surface);
    color: var(--color-accent);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
  }
  .pl-mode-note {
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    color: var(--color-muted);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .pl-assets {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
  }
  .pl-asset {
    border: var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: var(--space-sm);
    background: var(--color-bg);
  }
  .pl-asset-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
  }
  .pl-swatch {
    width: 0.8rem;
    height: 0.8rem;
    border-radius: 3px;
    flex: none;
  }
  .pl-swatch--port {
    background: var(--color-accent);
  }
  .pl-asset-name {
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: var(--step-0);
  }
  .pl-name-input {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: var(--step-0);
    border: none;
    border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--color-border);
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--color-text);
    width: 8rem;
  }
  .pl-name-input:focus {
    outline: none;
    border-bottom-color: var(--color-accent);
  }
  .pl-weight-badge {
    margin-left: auto;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }
  .pl-remove {
    border: none;
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    line-height: 1;
    cursor: pointer;
    padding: 0 0.2rem;
  }
  .pl-remove:hover:not(:disabled) {
    color: var(--color-error);
  }
  .pl-remove:disabled {
    opacity: 0.3;
    cursor: not-allowed;
  }
  .pl-weight input[type="range"] {
    width: 100%;
    accent-color: var(--color-accent);
    cursor: pointer;
    margin: 0.4rem 0;
  }
  .pl-params {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 0.4rem;
  }
  .pl-params label {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.2rem;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    color: var(--color-text-soft);
  }
  .pl-params label span {
    flex: none;
  }
  .pl-params input {
    width: 100%;
    min-width: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    padding: 0.2rem 0.3rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 5px;
    background: var(--color-surface);
    color: var(--color-text);
  }
  .pl-params input:disabled {
    opacity: 0.7;
    background: var(--color-surface-alt);
  }
  .pl-params em {
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-style: normal;
  }

  .pl-add-row {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }
  .pl-add {
    flex: 1;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    padding: 0.5rem;
    border: var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    background: var(--color-surface);
    color: var(--color-text);
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .pl-btn {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    font-weight: 600;
    padding: 0.5rem 0.8rem;
    border: var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    background: var(--color-surface);
    color: var(--color-text);
    cursor: pointer;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .pl-btn:hover {
    border-color: var(--color-accent);
  }
  .pl-horizon {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    color: var(--color-text-soft);
  }
  .pl-horizon strong {
    color: var(--color-text);
  }
  .pl-horizon input[type="range"] {
    width: 100%;
    accent-color: var(--color-accent);
    cursor: pointer;
    margin-top: 0.4rem;
  }

  /* ---- Visuals ---- */
  .pl-visuals {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-md);
    min-width: 0;
  }
  .pl-panel {
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: var(--space-md);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    min-width: 0;
  }
  .pl-panel-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .pl-panel-head h3 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: var(--step-1);
  }
  .pl-panel-tools {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .pl-check {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    color: var(--color-text-soft);
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .pl-canvas {
    width: 100%;
    height: 300px;
    display: block;
  }
  .pl-panel-row {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-md);
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }
  @media (min-width: 1180px) {
    .pl-panel-row {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 5fr) minmax(0, 4fr);
    }
  }

  .pl-frontier {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
  }
  .pl-grid {
    stroke: var(--color-border);
    stroke-width: 1;
  }
  .pl-axis {
    fill: var(--color-muted);
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 11px;
  }
  .pl-axis-title {
    fill: var(--color-text-soft);
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .pl-cloud-dot {
    fill: var(--color-accent);
  }
  .pl-marker {
    stroke: var(--color-surface);
    stroke-width: 2;
  }
  .pl-marker--current {
    fill: var(--color-accent);
  }
  .pl-marker-ring {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--color-accent);
    stroke-width: 1.5;
    opacity: 0.5;
  }
  .pl-marker--minvar {
    fill: var(--color-link);
  }
  .pl-marker--sharpe {
    fill: var(--color-warn);
  }

  .pl-legend {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.4rem 0.9rem;
    margin-top: var(--space-sm);
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    color: var(--color-text-soft);
  }
  .pl-legend-item {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.35rem;
  }
  .pl-legend-item--port .pl-swatch--port {
    width: 1.1rem;
    height: 0.3rem;
    border-radius: 2px;
  }
  .pl-dot {
    width: 0.7rem;
    height: 0.7rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    flex: none;
  }
  .pl-dot--current {
    background: var(--color-accent);
  }
  .pl-dot--minvar {
    background: var(--color-link);
  }
  .pl-dot--sharpe {
    background: var(--color-warn);
  }
  .pl-dot--asset {
    background: var(--color-muted);
  }
  .pl-caption {
    margin: var(--space-sm) 0 0;
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-style: italic;
  }

  /* ---- Readout ---- */
  .pl-stats {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: var(--space-sm);
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-md);
  }
  .pl-stats > div {
    min-width: 0;
    background: var(--color-surface-alt);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: var(--space-sm);
  }
  .pl-stats dt {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    color: var(--color-muted);
    margin-bottom: 0.2rem;
  }
  .pl-stats dd {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: var(--step-1);
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  .pl-diversify-title {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: var(--step-0);
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-sm);
  }
  .pl-bar {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.2rem 0.6rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  .pl-bar-label {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    color: var(--color-text-soft);
  }
  .pl-bar-value {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    grid-row: span 1;
  }
  .pl-bar-track {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
    height: 0.6rem;
    background: var(--color-surface-alt);
    border-radius: 999px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .pl-bar-fill {
    height: 100%;
    border-radius: 999px;
  }
  .pl-bar-fill--naive {
    background: var(--color-muted);
  }
  .pl-bar-fill--actual {
    background: var(--color-accent);
  }
  .pl-saved {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    color: var(--color-text-soft);
    margin: var(--space-sm) 0 0;
  }
  .pl-saved strong {
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .pl-disclaimer {
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-style: italic;
    margin: var(--space-sm) 0 0;
  }
</style>
